---
description: LLMLingua-2 prompt compression via MCP (token savings)
alwaysApply: false
---

Before producing a response on large inputs (logs, long files, verbose tool output),
call MCP server `llmlingua-compressor`, tool `optimize_context`, then reason on
the compressed context. Skip for short prompts. If the MCP call fails, continue
with the original context.

Target rates: default 0.50; explain/summarize 0.45; logs 0.40; refactor 0.55;
very large input (>500 lines) 0.30.
